Package: lz-disk-cleaner
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends},
         policykit-1,
         psmisc,
         lsof
Description: Disk cleaning and optimization tool
 LZ Disk Cleaner is a comprehensive disk cleaning and system
 optimization tool.
 .
 Features:
  - Disk usage analysis with visual charts
  - System cache and temporary file cleaning
  - Package cache cleaning (APT, Linglong)
  - System log cleanup
  - File shredder with secure deletion
  - System slimming and optimization
  - Real-time resource monitoring
  - Linglong application management
 .
 This tool helps users reclaim disk space and maintain system
 performance with an intuitive and user-friendly interface.

Package: lz-disk-cleaner-dbg
Architecture: any
Section: debug
Depends: lz-disk-cleaner (= ${binary:Version}),
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: Debug symbols for lz-disk-cleaner
 This package contains the debug symbols for lz-disk-cleaner,
 useful for debugging and development purposes.
